#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:4
msgid "Kubernetes Storage Management"
msgstr "Kubernetes Storage Management"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:9
msgid ""
"The Storage tab on a Kubernetes Cluster detail page provides management "
"of persistent storage resources within the cluster. |morpheus| syncs and "
"manages StorageClasses, Persistent Volumes (PVs), Persistent Volume "
"Claims (PVCs), ConfigMaps, and Secrets."
msgstr ""
"El Almacenamiento pestaña en un Kubernetes Clúster página de detalles "
"proporciona gestión de persistente storage recursos dentro de el cluster."
" |morpheus| sincroniza y gestiona StorageClasses, Persistente Volumes "
"(PVs), Persistente Volume Claims (PVCs), ConfigMaps, y Secrets."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:11
msgid ""
"Navigate to the Storage tab via ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [cluster "
"name] > Storage``."
msgstr ""
"Navegue un el Storage pestaña via ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [cluster "
"name] > Storage``."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:13
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:13
msgid ""
"Storage management requires ``Infrastructure: Clusters > Full`` Role "
"permission."
msgstr ""
"Almacenamiento gestión requiere ``Infrastructure: Clusters > Full`` Rol "
"permiso."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:16
msgid "Storage Classes"
msgstr "Storage Classes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:18
msgid ""
"StorageClasses define the types of storage available in the cluster. They"
" map to provisioners (e.g., OpenEBS, Rook/Ceph, AWS EBS, vSphere volumes)"
" and define parameters for dynamically provisioned volumes."
msgstr ""
"StorageClasses define el tipos de storage disponible en el cluster. They "
"mapear a provisioners (e.g., OpenEBS, Rook/Ceph, AWS EBS, vSphere "
"volúmenes) y define parámetros para dinámicamente aprovisionado "
"volúmenes."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:21
msgid "Viewing Storage Classes"
msgstr "Viewing Storage Classes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:23
msgid ""
"The Storage Classes subtab displays all StorageClasses synced from the "
"cluster, including:"
msgstr ""
"El Almacenamiento Classes subtab muestra todos StorageClasses "
"sincronizado desde el cluster, incluyendo:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:25
msgid "**NAME** — StorageClass name"
msgstr "**NAME** — StorageClass nombre"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:26
msgid ""
"**PROVISIONER** — The storage provisioner (e.g., ``kubernetes.io/no-"
"provisioner``, ``openebs.io/local``, ``rook-ceph.rbd.csi.ceph.com``)"
msgstr ""
"**PROVISIONER** — El storage provisioner (e.g., ``kubernetes.io/no-"
"provisioner``, ``openebs.io/local``, ``rook-ceph.rbd.csi.ceph.com``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:27
msgid ""
"**RECLAIM POLICY** — What happens to PVs when released (``Retain``, "
"``Delete``, ``Recycle``)"
msgstr ""
"**RECLAIM POLICY** — Qué happens a PVs cuando released (``Retain``, "
"``Delete``, ``Recycle``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:28
msgid ""
"**VOLUME BINDING MODE** — When volume binding occurs (``Immediate``, "
"``WaitForFirstConsumer``)"
msgstr ""
"**VOLUME BINDING MODE** — Cuando volumen binding occurs (``Immediate``, "
"``WaitForFirstConsumer``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:29
msgid "**DEFAULT** — Whether this is the cluster's default StorageClass"
msgstr "**DEFAULT** — Whether este es el cluster's predeterminado StorageClass"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:31
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:31
msgid ""
"When using |morpheus| Kubernetes clusters with OpenEBS, ensure a default "
"StorageClass is available so that Kubernetes specs or Helm templates "
"using a default StorageClass for PVCs can be utilized."
msgstr ""
"Cuando usando |morpheus| Kubernetes clusters con OpenEBS, asegurar un "
"predeterminado StorageClass está disponible así ese Kubernetes specs o "
"Helm templates usando un predeterminado StorageClass para PVCs puede be "
"utilized."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:34
msgid "Persistent Volumes (PVs)"
msgstr "Persistente Volumes (PVs)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/storage.rst:36
msgid ""
"Persistent Volumes represent physical storage resources in the cluster "
"that have been provisioned by an administrator or dynamically provisioned"
" using a StorageClass."
msgstr ""
"Persistente Volumes represent physical storage recursos en el cluster ese"
" tienen been aprovisionado por un administrator o dinámicamente "
"aprovisionado usando un StorageClass."

